item.description:
*Originally posted on Facebook, October 3, 2017*

the Judgments of God are Righteous and Holy;
we are sinners and have well earned the wrath of God.
LORD Jesus have mercy on us; sinners;
wash us with Thy blood.

*Originally posted on Facebook, October 6, 2017*

There is a Zach im seeking for;
one who is gentle and giving and forgiving.
...but for most of us, we feel so shut out from light in this world
we die without real peace, or even kill ourselves.

For all of us who cherish the Zach of Peace and Spirit,
may we all forgive and support our fellows in these dark times;

we never know which breath may be our last;
we never know which words are the last we share.

*Originally posted on Facebook, October 27, 2017*

This has nothing to do with beatrix or brook growing
or being fulfilled;
but rather the opposite;
about beatrix and brook being vanquished
as a shadow
by Light;
Jesus Christ Himself

God's will is that nothing belonging to brook or beatrix remains;
neither body nor spirit;
that death be swallowed up in victory in Christ 
and only Jesus' church remains;
whose names the LORD has prepared
for those; born again by Spirit
who love the Law of God;
Truth and Light Himself:
Jesus Christ our LORD
and His appearing

