*Originally posted on Facebook, December 17, 2017*

Our God is the arm of power always;
most notedly in our powerlessness when we rest on Him.

Our God is the heart of tender mercy;
when we need to be understood and heard;
when we long for One to share our tears.

Our God is the mind and wisdom of all life;
our every desire and purpose and fulfillment
are utterly complete
in Him.

*Originally posted on Facebook, December 18, 2017*

I thank God for my grandfather;
who taught me to fish on the ocean.
I thank God for my father;
who brought me fishing in Belize.
I thank God for my step-father;
who conquered the tidal whirlpool for our journey.

And most of all, i thank our Father;
and Jesus Christ as One:
Who are teaching me to fish for men.

*Originally posted on Facebook, January 1, 2018*

https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9zl-F1DcfHg&feature=youtu.be

Hosea10:12  Sow to yourselves in righteousness, reap in mercy;
break up your fallow ground:
for it is time to seek the LORD,
till He come and rain righteousness upon you.
